WEBVTT

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.720
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:23.250
In this wide world

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.420
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:35.000
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.630
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:45.740
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.710
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:56.020
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.780
Awaken now

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:12.070
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:19.340
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:22.110
It's certain

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:26.480
Woh woh

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:34.390
You got a haircut, huh?

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:37.660
It looks nice.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:41.670
Um... Th-Thanks!
Uh, sure...

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:45.360
S-So... shall we go?
The movie will be
starting soon.
Uh... Sure.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:51.100
I had no idea how just
hearing those words from
the one you love could
make you so happy.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:14.400
Don't try to be nice.
After all, she's the
one you really like...

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.070
Now I know who really
cares about me...

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.400
That's a lie!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.910
Ah... *Squeeze*

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.410
I finally understand
how I really feel.
*Shpshhhh*
I love you.
I won't ever let you go.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:29.910
I love you, too.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:34.350
May the two of you
always be happy.
As happy as I would Too bad for me.
Have been and more...

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:33.870
Woh, it starts to shine

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:50.660
The gentle wind I felt on my cheek

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:59.430
Was the start of the miracles you brought

00:23:00.110 --> 00:23:07.570
As though my everyday life until
then had never existed

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:13.190
My new happy life, completely repainted

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:16.590
In the colors of spring

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:21.530
Even waking up early, even traffic jams

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:25.940
Even heavy things to carry,
even sleepless nights

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:30.270
Somehow I feel thankful for everything

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:34.980
Let's create more and more of our miracles

00:23:34.980 --> 00:23:42.820
Woh, whatever kind of morning

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:51.320
Woh, it starts to shine

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:54.830
Every day is a miracle

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:09.630
Ah! I Just Can't Say It!
